%% aoneahsan-cccs-fix-reported-issues — full flow
flowchart TD
    trigger([Session starts in an owned project<br/>or the hook reminder fires]) --> check[grep for open entries:<br/>lines starting with ### ISSUE-<br/>in docs/REPORTED-ISSUES.md]
    check --> any{Open issues?}
    any -->|no| normal([Proceed with the session task])
    any -->|yes| surface[Surface the queue to the owner<br/>alongside the session task.<br/>Default: the queue comes first —<br/>downstream consumers live with these bugs]

    surface --> pick[Pick ONE issue —<br/>oldest first unless severity wins]
    pick --> plan[PLAN on the configured Fable model —<br/>read the full entry, then VERIFY the<br/>recorded root cause against the code]
    plan --> realbug{Actually a bug?}
    realbug -->|no — misuse or stale version| explain[Move to RESOLVED with the<br/>explanation so it is never re-filed]
    realbug -->|yes| implement[IMPLEMENT on the configured Opus model, main context,<br/>stack-matching skills invoked.<br/>Fix the CAUSE, not the reported symptom]

    implement --> verify[Project gates: typecheck, lint,<br/>build, tests — PLUS the entry's exact<br/>repro no longer misbehaves]
    verify --> pass{All green?}
    pass -->|no| implement
    pass -->|blocked — needs owner input,<br/>credentials, device| hold[Entry stays OPEN with a dated<br/>progress note. Ask the owner and<br/>PAUSE per ask-the-owner]
    pass -->|yes| move[ONE edit pair, same commit as the fix:<br/>cut from REPORTED-ISSUES.md, append to<br/>RESOLVED-ISSUES.md with resolution date +<br/>fixing version or deploy marker.<br/>Original body intact — never delete]

    explain --> propagate
    move --> propagate[Propagate: rules-KB quirk marked<br/>RESOLVED with the version; release per<br/>the project's own rules; owner-only<br/>steps to docs/MANUAL-TASKS.md]
    propagate --> more{More open issues?}
    more -->|yes| pick
    more -->|no| done([Queue empty — continue the<br/>session's actual task])
    hold --> more

    classDef gateNode fill:#fff4e6,stroke:#d97706,color:#7c2d12
    classDef terminal fill:#ecfdf5,stroke:#059669,color:#064e3b
    class any,realbug,pass,more gateNode
    class trigger,normal,done terminal
